Material Symbols

Source: https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
Revision: 10ecc14790612ca8fd164e3f4ffe9c16fc50d5b7
The files in material/ are the 24px Material Symbols Outlined SVGs from the
symbols/web directory. SeniorMode added a common fill for contrast in light
and dark themes. The Apache License 2.0 is in material/LICENSE.

Product marks

The files in brands/ are the original product marks from the sources below.
The names of the local files indicate the intended background. The marks
identify supported installation targets and belong to their respective owners.

- Cursor 2D cube: https://cursor.com/en-US/brand
- Gemini CLI full-color icon: https://geminicli.com/brand-kit/
- OpenCode standalone mark: https://opencode.ai/brand
